1:29:00.00 --> 1:41:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Hector suspends a woman in air - with an injection next to her. Green lantern tricks Hector by giving him a malfunctioning ring - which causes Hector to get knocked out. Parallax arrives and consumes Hector. Green lantern fires a missile and Parallax retreats. Parallax then turns to the city - sweeping the streets - and killing many on the streets. We see them turn to a skeleton before getting sucked by Parallax. Green lantern lures Parallax into space - and gets him into range of the sun. The sun sucks Parallax in killing him, while Green lantern is saved.)

